))TO('DATE')                                                            39300003
           - SPECIFIES THE RETENTION PERIOD FOR THE ENTRY BEING         39350003
             DEFINED.                                                   39400003
  'DATE'   - DATE (YYDDD) THROUGH WHICH THE ENTRY BEING DEFINED IS TO   39450003
             BE KEPT.                                                   39500003
))FOR('DAYS')                                                           39550003
           - SPECIFIES THE RETENTION PERIOD FOR THE ENTRY BEING         39600003
