             CAN BE ASSOCIATED WITH THE GENERATION DATA GROUP TO BE     42000002
             DEFINED.                                                   43000002
  'LIMIT'  - MAXIMUM NUMBER OF GENERATION DATA SETS THAT CAN BE         44000002
             ASSOCIATED WITH THE GENERATION DATA GROUP TO BE DEFINED.   45000002
))CATALOG('CATNAME/PASSWORD')                                           46000003
